=============================================================================


 WHAT IS traf ?  
================

traf is a network traffic monitor. traf is especially useful for network 
administrators, helping them with planning, and seeking out bottle necks in a 
network. It can also be used to check on the users of a network.

Install traf and use 

	#prompt#> traf -help 

for more information (See NOTES WHEN USING TRAF section 5 before running it ).


