Begin3
Title:		Dial-Up_Utils
Version:	1.1
Entered-date:	9 Apr 1996
Description:	Various utility programs to facilitate the administration
		of a Dial-Up / BBS under Linux.  Dial-Up Utils may be
		used in conjunction with a BBS package.
Keywords:	dial-up modem pool bbs administration
Author:		Adam.McKee@usask.ca (Adam McKee)
Maintained-by:	Adam.McKee@usask.ca (Adam McKee) 
Primary-site:	sunsite.unc.edu
Copying-policy:	GPL
