I just uploaded man-pages-de-0.1.tar.gz to
ftp.win.tue.nl:/pub/linux/man/man-pages-de-0.1.tar.gz
and sunsite.unc.edu and tsx-11.mit.edu, where it still
will be in [Ii]ncoming.

This is the first release of a package of man pages in German,
and contains some 150 man pages. Of this, 60% is the work of
Sebastian Hetze, who translated some 90 Chapter 1 pages.
The rest has been translated by several people over the
past few months - see the Announce file for credits.

