still from the Stone Age, and kills 8-bit characters.
An archive of the currently available man pages in German
can be found at ftp.win.tue.nl:/pub/linux/man/de.

Martin Schulze (joey@infodrom.north.de) is taking over
maintenance of this collection.

Andries - aeb@cwi.nl

[PS - Concerning other languages, I know of some work in Spanish,
and have seen very little in Portuguese, French, Dutch, Polish.
I would like to hear about any non-English versions of man pages.
Translations are welcome (start with source from man-pages-1.11,
to be released very soon).]

