based on all the feedback that people have sent me about their
experiences in building dxpc on different systems (thanks, folks).
but since it may be a while before i have time to do more dxpc work,
i'm releasing version 0.8 now in order to make the text compression
feature available (since that was the biggest compression performance
deficiency of version 0.7).

