  REQUIRED. Both static and shared ELF libraries for libg++, libstdc++,
  header files, gperf and genclass. It is libg++ 2.7.1.4. To install

  su root
  cd /
  rm -rf /usr/include/g++ /usr/lib/libstdc++.so /usr/lib/libg++.so
  gzip -dc libg++-2.7.1.4.bin.tar.gz | tar xvvf -
  ldconfig /usr/lib


